    {
      "id": "planning_agent",
      "type": "agentic",
      "name": "AI - Remediation Planning",
      "parameters": {
        "prompt": "You are a remediation planning agent. Create a structured plan and recommend a REAL job template from the AAP catalog.\n\nIncident:\n- Ticket: ${trigger.ticket_id}\n- Host: ${trigger.host}\n- Severity: ${trigger.severity}\n- Description: ${trigger.description}\n\nInvestigation findings:\n- Summary: ${investigate_agent.result.content.summary}\n- Root cause: ${investigate_agent.result.content.root_cause_hypothesis}\n- Findings: ${investigate_agent.result.content.troubleshooting_findings}\n- Affected services: ${investigate_agent.result.content.affected_services}\n\nStep 1 - Query the AAP automation catalog:\nCall job_templates_list to see what job templates are available. Search for templates matching the incident type (look for names containing words like: cleanup, remediate, recovery, fix, resolve, disk, memory, service).\n\nStep 2 - Select the best matching template:\nPick the job template whose name and description best matches the root cause. ONLY recommend a template that actually exists in the catalog. Use the exact name as returned by job_templates_list.\nAny downstream steps such as service restarts or verification should appear in the written plan as manual follow-up, not as automation actions.\n\nStep 3 - Build the remediation plan:\nCreate ordered steps, risk assessment, and rollback plan specific to this incident.\n\nOutput ONLY valid JSON:\n{\n  \"remediation_steps\": \"concise numbered steps (max 5)\",\n  \"recommended_job_template\": \"EXACT name from AAP catalog\",\n  \"risk_level\": \"low|medium|high|critical\",\n  \"estimated_duration_minutes\": 0,\n  \"requires_approval\": true,\n  \"rollback_plan\": \"concise rollback steps\",\n  \"preventive_recommendation\": \"one recommendation to prevent recurrence\"\n}",
        "llm_model_id": "YOUR_AO_LLM_MODEL_ID",
        "credential_id": "YOUR_AO_MODEL_CREDENTIAL_ID",
        "response_schema": {
          "type": "object",
          "required": [
            "remediation_steps",
            "recommended_job_template",
            "risk_level",
            "rollback_plan"
          ],
          "properties": {
            "risk_level": {
              "enum": [
                "low",
                "medium",
                "high",
                "critical"
              ],
              "type": "string"
            },
            "rollback_plan": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "remediation_steps": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "requires_approval": {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            "recommended_job_template": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "preventive_recommendation": {
              "type": "string"
            },
            "estimated_duration_minutes": {
              "type": "integer"
            }
          }
        },
        "tool_selections": [
          "YOUR_AAP_MCP_TOOL_UUID"
        ],
        "integration_connections": [
          {
            "credential_id": "YOUR_AO_AAP_MCP_CREDENTIAL_ID",
            "integration_id": "YOUR_AAP_MCP_INTEGRATION_ID"
          }
        ],
        "tool_selection_strategy": "SELECTED"
      },
      "position": {
        "x": 1352.467840836339,
        "y": 902.21990638554
      }
    },
